## Minigun Charge-up system strings

# Shown as a floating popup to the shooter when the spin-up begins.
minigun-charge-whirr-self = The minigun begins to whirr...

# Shown in the chat box to nearby players (emote range) when the spin-up begins.
minigun-charge-whirr-others = *you hear a menacing mechanical whirr nearby...*

# Shown when the user tries to fire while the gun is still spinning up.
minigun-charge-already-charging = The barrels are still spinning up!

# Shown to the shooter when the spin-up completes and the gun is ready to fire.
minigun-charge-ready = The minigun is up to speed — fire at will!
